Bit manipulation has maybe 15 tricks total.

Most people know 3 of them and get stuck on everything else.

This post has all 15 — with explanations, C++ code, and
real LeetCode problems for each one.

Read it once. Bookmark it. Never get stuck on a bit problem again.

